ouse dreams pink recolour.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Black roses have been replaced with the dollhouse dreams pink recolour as well.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;The &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/699211"&gt;transparency mod by CristataWolf&lt;/a&gt; has been made compatiable with this mod, I followed CristataWolf's tutorial included in their mod's zipped folder to make it compitable with this flora mod as they unfortunately use the same modding directory with files being SeasonsXX; please refer to their mod's page on more information about the mod and how it works. &lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;However&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;, if CristataWolf wishes for me to remove this mod from being included in this mod/mod pack I will respect that and remove it. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod looks better when paired with the &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/717082"&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Dreamy Town Tree mod&lt;/a&gt; which will be included in the mod pack or you can download it seperately.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/do9i0h.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;CONFLICTING MODS&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod will conflict with anything in &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/cats/43264"&gt;&lt;u&gt;this modding category&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;                           &lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/isgx7t.gif"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Installation instructions can be found &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fkikifrommeadow.com%2F2026%2F06%2F12%2Fhow-to-create-texture-mods-for-animal-crossing-new-leaf%2F&amp;follow=true"&gt;&lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please do &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; reupload my mods without my permission, this includes but not limited to: reposting/reuploading, editing/modifying, put under a paywall/reselling and/or claim ownership of my mods