    <item>
      <title>Southern Hemisphere &amp; Fruit Auto-Stack — New Leaf</title>
      <author>elmagoberlin</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/724403</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/724403#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">e429a7aa0cba029d5e4fe084b00ecc8a0e813b69</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 13:09:32 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac3a11182b04.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac3a117207cc.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;Southern Hemisphere + Fruit Auto-Stack is a two-part quality-of-life and seasonal mod for Animal Crossing: New Leaf – Welcome amiibo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The release includes THREE separate IPS versions, allowing you to use either feature individually or both together.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Southern Hemisphere — Standalone&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. Fruit Auto-Stack — Standalone&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Southern Hemisphere + Fruit Auto-Stack — Combined&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Only IPS patch files are distributed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;No ROM, CIA, Nintendo assets, textures, models or original game files are included.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;FEATURES&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SOUTHERN HEMISPHERE&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Southern Hemisphere seasonal progression&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• January = Summer&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• July = Winter&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Seasonal vegetation follows the shifted cycle&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Winter and snow behavior follow the Southern winter&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Seasonal fish availability is shifted&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Seasonal insect availability is shifted&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Seasonal sea creature availability is shifted&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Civil calendar remains unchanged&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Birthdays remain unchanged&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Holidays and special events remain on their original dates&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;FRUIT AUTO-STACK&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Automatically stacks matching fruit when picked up&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Existing baskets can be filled up to 9&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Matching loose fruit can automatically become a basket of 2&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Supports normal fruit&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Supports perfect fruit&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Perfect and normal fruit remain separate&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Different species never mix&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Full baskets remain capped at 9&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Vanilla inventory behavior is preserved when no valid stack exists&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Stack counts persist normally after saving and reloading&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;COMPATIBILITY&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Game:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Animal Crossing: New Leaf – Welcome amiibo&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Region:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;North America / USA&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Title ID:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;0004000000198E00&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Patch format:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;IPS / code.ips&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tested on:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Azahar&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Other game regions or revisions have not currently been validated.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;INSTALLATION — AZAHAR&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Close Animal Crossing: New Leaf.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. Choose ONE of the three included IPS versions:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;   • Southern Hemisphere&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;   • Fruit Auto-Stack&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;   • Southern Hemisphere + Fruit Auto-Stack&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Rename the selected patch to:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;code.ips&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;if it is not already named that way.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Place it inside:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Azahar/load/mods/0004000000198E00/code.ips&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Example Windows location:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;C:\Users\&lt;YourName&gt;\AppData\Roaming\Azahar\load\mods\0004000000198E00\code.ips&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5. Start Animal Crossing: New Leaf – Welcome amiibo normally.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;To uninstall the mod, simply remove code.ips from that folder.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/acnl_southern_hemisphere_and_fruit_autostack_v10.zip" type="application/zip"/>
