      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac15156f109e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac152e1da071.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/u8n0e9.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;♡ &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdiscord.gg%2FZdFazKAkpy&amp;follow=true"&gt;Join my discord server for modding help, mod work in progress pics, mod requests and more!&lt;/a&gt; ♡&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;                    ㅤㅤ  ㅤ&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/olqv20.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;ㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤ&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Celebrating my birthday for 2026 !!!&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod modifies the geisha wig making it into a curly side ponytail hairstyle instead. The hairstyle is inspired by a side ponytail wig from AC: Pocket Camp!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ㅤㅤ&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡ In-game colour compatible: ✓ | 3DS: ✓ | Emulator: ✓ &lt;/span&gt;♡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;                          &lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/isgx7t.gif"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Vapecord IDs: &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;2891&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;- Geisha Wig&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/do9i0h.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;CONFLICTING MODS&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod will conflict with any mod that uses the geisha wig -  "hlmt_wig_geisha.bcres". This is because the files will overwrite each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Credits: &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I used a face texture by &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/3715646"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;MangoMikii &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;for the blender thumbnail render **however** the finished thumbnail is edited by myself.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;                           &lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/isgx7t.gif"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Installation instructions can be found &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fkikifrommeadow.com%2F2026%2F06%2F12%2Fhow-to-create-texture-mods-for-animal-crossing-new-leaf%2F&amp;follow=true" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please do &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; reupload my mods without my permission, this includes but not limited to: reposting/reuploading, editing/modifying, put under a paywall/reselling and/or claim ownership of my mods. This all falls under the Creative Commons License. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If there are any issues please don't hestitate to contact me via Tumblr DMS &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fkikifrommeadow.tumblr.com%2F&amp;follow=true"&gt;kikifrommeadow&lt;/a&gt; or alternatively comment under this post, I'll try and get back to you ASAP.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;  If you use my mods please tag me on social media so I can see ! I'd love to see your creations!&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt; &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/umflbu.png"&gt;</description>
