      <title>New Leaf Inclusive Skin Tones</title>
      <author>CinnamonClover</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/723355</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/723355#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">5e16508bc68b82e0acb4923440e2d5e43d41507e</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 02:31:54 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac0685162690.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d547bea5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d54bfe49.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d54c4896.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d54c9a2c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d54cdeae.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d546c442.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d54d4d8d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d54d62bb.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d583470f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d583737c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d5834c6e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d584ad3a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d5870622.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d584b0f4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d5840bb4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d5854ea9.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d58472fe.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d583f4f8.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d583f207.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d583ed3a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d58412d5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d584258b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac05d5842da9.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;NOTICE: This patch utilizes AI-assisted coding. ChatGPT was used to decode the original source files, troubleshoot errors, and generate the specific replacement code lines used in this update.&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_2i" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;Inclusive Skin Tones&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_2o" data-hveid="CAAIFRAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;As many positive things as can be said about the amazing game that is Animal Crossing, it is unfortunate, to say the least, that it took the series nearly 20 years to recognize that skin tones other than white existed.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_2u" data-hveid="CAAIFhAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;In the base game, the only way to change your skin tone is by “tanning” for hours of real-life time to temporarily appear a darker shade.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_30" data-hveid="CAAIFxAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;Well, no longer.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_36" data-hveid="CAAIGBAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;With this mod, it is as simple as dropping a single file into your mods folder and, boom, you can start out with any of the &lt;span class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_37" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;5 natural skin tone options&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt; included in this pack AND still utilize the in-game tanning mechanic, if you so choose, to deepen your skin tone.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_3d" data-hveid="CAAIGRAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;Each natural skin tone option includes its own subtle 8-stage tanning progression, so tanning deepens your chosen complexion instead of shifting you into a completely different skin tone.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_3j" data-hveid="CAAIGhAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;This mod is compatible with both emulators and modded consoles, and is also compatible with my 4x Upscale Mod, as well as any other upscale or retexture mods.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_3p" data-hveid="CAAIGxAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;This is Version 1.0, so there may be bugs or issues with the initial release. If you encounter any, please comment below.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_3v" data-hveid="CAAIHBAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;In later iterations, I would also love to potentially add different tanning types for people who may burn instead of tan, as well as warmer and cooler undertones.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_41" data-hveid="CAAIHRAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;There are also 3 fantasy options available in pink, purple, and green. In future releases or expanded editions, I may add more fantasy color options as well. If there is a color you would like to see, feel free to drop it in the comments below.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_48" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;Installation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_4e" data-hveid="CAAIHxAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_4f" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;Azahar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;To install on Azahar:&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ol class="T9WCjf qkgVBf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="PnN4Le#N1SbDe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_4m" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;&lt;li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_4n" data-hveid="CAAIIBAB" data-complete="true" data-sae=""&gt;&lt;span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_4o" data-complete="true"&gt;Right-click your Animal Crossing: New Leaf – Welcome Amiibo game.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_4p" data-hveid="CAAIIBAC" data-complete="true" data-sae=""&gt;&lt;span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_4q" data-complete="true"&gt;Click &lt;span class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_4r" data-complete="true"&gt;Open &amp;gt; Mods Location&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_4s" data-hveid="CAAIIBAD" data-complete="true" data-sae=""&gt;&lt;span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_4t" data-complete="true"&gt;Drop the entire &lt;code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_4u" data-complete="true" data-sae=""&gt;exefs&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/code&gt; folder into the mods folder.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_4v" data-hveid="CAAIIBAE" data-complete="true" data-sae=""&gt;&lt;span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_4w" data-complete="true"&gt;Boot up your game and enjoy.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_52" data-hveid="CAAIIRAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_53" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;Luma3DS / Modded 3DS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;To install with Luma3DS on a modded 3DS:&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ol class="T9WCjf qkgVBf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="PnN4Le#N1SbDe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_5a" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"&gt;&lt;li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_5b" data-hveid="CAAIIhAB" data-complete="true" data-sae=""&gt;&lt;span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_5c" data-complete="true"&gt;Make sure &lt;span class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_5d" data-complete="true"&gt;Game Patching&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is enabled in Luma3DS.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_5e" data-hveid="CAAIIhAC" data-complete="true" data-sae=""&gt;&lt;span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_5f" data-complete="true"&gt;Take the &lt;code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_5g" data-complete="true" data-sae=""&gt;code.bin&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/code&gt; file from the &lt;code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_5h" data-complete="true" data-sae=""&gt;exefs&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/code&gt; folder.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_5i" data-hveid="CAAIIhAD" data-complete="true" data-sae=""&gt;&lt;span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="mbqYvd_5j" data-complete="true"&gt;Place it on your SD card at:&lt;br jsaction="" jscontroller="iO7NKc#B4oRN" data-sf