      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abff3de9b584.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abff3fa1feaf.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abff405ad54a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abff411afb81.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abff42a0d6d3.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abff44ecfca8.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac56a27914ff.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac56a325c5dc.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;I'm back for the spooky season with a new recolor mod ,this recolors the items "Creepy Cauldron" "Creepy Crystal" and the "Creepy Coffin" into Sweet Pastel and Spooky Dark colors~&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;Known Issues&lt;br&gt;Sweet versions of the crystal ball table may appear with black texture on 3ds Hardware.&lt;br&gt;All versions of the cauldron have weird dark textures over the wood.&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;Creepy cauldron - not in stores (obtain from jack) - int_hor_kame - itemID:2AA5 itemIDWA:2B4F&lt;br&gt;Creepy crystal- not in stores (obtain from jack) - int_hor_table - itemID:2AA9 itemIDWA:2B53&lt;br&gt;Creepy coffin - not in stores (obtain from jack) - int_hor_kanoke_chestB - itemID:2AA8 itemIDWA:2B52&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;Other mods in screenshots&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dress QR codes: Please see preview photos for QR (its a bit difficult for me to find the original artists of the QR codes with all the endless reposts over the years, if found, lemme know for proper credit c:)&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;	Pastel Purple Dress - artist unknown until found&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;	Dark Purple Dress - artist unknown until found&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/725396"&gt;Witches Hat by Me&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/499391"&gt;Wallpaper&lt;/